"00:15.020" end="00:15.260">be </span><span begin="00:15.260" end="00:16.580">farther</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:16.700" end="00:19.940"><span begin="00:16.700" end="00:17.000">So </span><span begin="00:17.000" end="00:17.270">how's </span><span begin="00:17.270" end="00:17.360">it </span><span begin="00:17.360" end="00:17.630">feel </span><span begin="00:17.630" end="00:17.750">to </span><span begin="00:17.750" end="00:18.290">be </span><span begin="00:18.290" end="00:18.440">on </span><span begin="00:18.440" end="00:18.920">the </span><span begin="00:18.920" end="00:19.130">other </span><span begin="00:19.130" end="00:19.940">side</span><span begin="00:19.940" end="00:19.940">?</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:19.940" end="00:22.340"><span begin="00:19.940" end="00:20.150">So </span><span begin="00:20.150" end="00:20.780">many </span><span begin="00:20.780" end="00:21.680">wasted </span><span begin="00:21.680" end="00:21.680">（</span><span begin="00:21.680" end="00:22.310">Wasted</span><span begin="00:22.310" end="00:22.340">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.340" end="00:26.390"><span begin="00:22.340" end="00:22.850">Nights </span><span begin="00:22.850" end="00:23.480">with </span><span begin="00:23.480" end="00:23.480">（</span><span begin="00:23.480" end="00:23.630">Nights </span><span begin="00:23.630" end="00:23.780">with</span><span begin="00:23.780" end="00:23.780">） </span><span begin="00:23.780" end="00:24.890">you </span><span begin="00:24.890" end="00:24.920">（</span><span begin="00:24.920" end="00:25.460">You</span><span begin="00:25.460" end="00:26.390">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.390" end="00:28.580"><span begin="00:26.390" end="00:26.480">I </span><span begin="00:26.480" end="00:26.930">still </span><span begin="00:26.930" end="00:27.200">could </span><span begin="00:27.200" end="00:27.710">taste </span><span begin="00:27.710" end="00:27.770">it </span><span begin="00:27.770" end="00:27.770">（</span><span begi