" end="00:52.790">hurts </span><span begin="00:52.790" end="00:52.940">the </span><span begin="00:52.940" end="00:53.480">most </span><span begin="00:53.480" end="00:53.630">is </span><span begin="00:53.630" end="00:54.320">people </span><span begin="00:54.320" end="00:54.590">can </span><span begin="00:54.590" end="00:54.920">go</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:54.920" end="00:58.520"><span begin="00:54.920" end="00:55.190">From </span><span begin="00:55.190" end="00:55.970">people </span><span begin="00:55.970" end="00:56.150">you </span><span begin="00:56.150" end="00:56.540">know </span><span begin="00:56.540" end="00:56.750">to </span><span begin="00:56.750" end="00:57.620">people </span><span begin="00:57.620" end="00:57.770">you </span><span begin="00:57.770" end="00:58.520">don't</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:58.550" end="01:01.850"><span begin="00:58.550" end="00:58.880">When </span><span begin="00:58.880" end="00:59.000">it </span><span begin="00:59.000" end="00:59.240">was </span><span begin="00:59.240" end="00:59.420">good</span><span begin="00:59.420" end="00:59.420">, </span><span begin="00:59.420" end="00:59.630">we </span><span begin="00:59.630" end="00:59.960">were </span><span begin="00:59.960" end="01:00.200">on </span><span begin="01:00.200" end="01:01.850">fire</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:02.180" end="01:04.760"><span begin="01:02.180" end="01:02.480">Now </span><span begin="01:02.480" end="01:02.600">I'm </span><span begin="01:02.600" end="01:03.320">breathin' </span><span begin="01:03.320" end="01:03.890">ashes </span><span begin="01:03.890" end="01:04.010">and </span><span begin="01:04.010" end="01:04.760">dust</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:05.150" end="01:08.030"><span begin="01:05.150" end="01:05.420">I </span><span begin="01:05.420" end="01:05.840">always </span><span begin="01:05.840" end="01:06.230">wanna </span><span begin="01:06.230" end="01:06.530">get </span><span begin="01:06.530" end="01:08.030">highe